The National Defense General Staff shall be
organized into five Divisions, each under the direction of
an Assistant Chief of Staff, as follows:
(a) Plans and Operations Division (OPD);
(0) Personnel and Administration Division (G-1);
(c) Intelligence Division (G-2);
(d) Organization and Training Division (G3); and
(e) Service, Supply and Procurement Division (G4).

The following constitute the Technical Staffs
and Services under the Chief of Staff:
(a) Corps of Engineers;
(b) Ordnance Service;
(c) Quartermaster Service;
(d) Signal Corps;
(e) Medical Service; and
(f) Finance Service.
NATIONAL DEFENSE SPECIAL STAFF DIVISIONS
